  "notes": [
    "Pilot SPM33 multifunction meter. Real-time registers of section 5.1; the demand, harmonic and configuration lists are not in this map.",
    "The manual numbers registers from 40001, so address 0 is 40001. 32-bit values are low word first (word order little). Function 03 reads the registers.",
    "Voltages, currents and powers are secondary-side values: multiply by the CT ratio (register 40) for primary values. The energy registers from 51 are primary-side.",
    "RTU, 8 data bits, no parity, 1 stop bit.",
    "Not tested on a device."
  ],
  "byte_order": "big",
  "word_order": "little",
